OL,3,GNEWSAThree murder arrests after man
OL,4,Adies in stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men and a woman have been arrested
OL,7,Fafter a man died from stab wounds.
OL,9,FDurham Police was called to an address
OL,10,Fin Thames Road in Peterlee shortly
OL,11,Fbefore midnight on Wednesday to reports
OL,12,Fof a man who had been stabbed.
OL,14,FA man in his 50s died in hospital
OL,15,Fshortly after. A cordon is in place at
OL,16,Fthe scene to allow forensic
OL,17,Finvestigations to go ahead, with
OL,18,Fofficers expecting it to remain for
OL,19,Fsome time.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
